# El Toque API token — free, from https://tasas-token.eltoque.com/
#
# Server-side only. Deliberately NOT prefixed with VITE_, so Vite cannot inline
# it into the client bundle. It is read by api/eltoque-rate.ts.
#
# Set the same variable in Vercel: Project > Settings > Environment Variables.
ELTOQUE_TOKEN=
